# Weekly progress report style

**Full guide:** [`docs/weekly-progress-report-style.md`](../../docs/weekly-progress-report-style.md)

## Formula (required order)

1. **Overview** — six sentences: on/off track · score + pts since last week · sessions + practice count · topics · skill/accuracy gains · next week
2. **Score Progression** — chart
3. **Weekly Summary** — each session + topic
4. **Aha Moments**
5. **Practice & Homework** (complete ≠ accuracy)
6. **Skills & Accuracy**
7. **What's Next**

## Voice

Plain, direct, owner copy verbatim when provided. No passage codenames in aha bullets. No tutor jargon or defensive disclaimers.

Also enforce [`messaging-guide.mdc`](messaging-guide.mdc) and [`banned-copy-phrases.mdc`](banned-copy-phrases.mdc).
